# Tauri's build output and what it generates: `target/` is the Rust build, and `gen/`
# holds the schemas and the Xcode-side files tauri writes.
src-tauri/target
src-tauri/gen

# The repo-root ignore file excludes `lib/` (Python packaging); this project's
# `src/lib/` is source and must stay tracked.
!src/lib/

